---
// 调试回调页面
const params = new URLSearchParams(Astro.url.search);
const allParams = Object.fromEntries(params.entries());
---

<html>
<head>
  <title>Callback Debug</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: monospace; padding: 20px; background: #f5f5f5; }
    .debug { background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 10px 0; }
    .success { border-left: 4px solid #4CAF50; }
    .error { border-left: 4px solid #f44336; }
    .warning { border-left: 4px solid #ff9800; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>🔍 Callback Debug Page</h1>
  
  <div class="debug warning">
    <h3>URL Parameters Received:</h3>
    <pre>{JSON.stringify(allParams, null, 2)}</pre>
  </div>
  
  <div class="debug">
    <h3>Full URL:</h3>
    <pre>{Astro.url.toString()}</pre>
  </div>
  
  <div class="debug">
    <h3>Expected Parameters:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>code</strong>: Authorization code from Supabase</li>
      <li><strong>next</strong>: Redirect target after authentication</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  
  <div class="debug">
    <h3>Next Steps:</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>If you see a 'code' parameter above, the magic link is working</li>
      <li>If no 'code', check Supabase project URL configuration</li>
      <li>Expected callback URL should be: <code>http://localhost:4321/api/auth/callback</code></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  
  <script>
    console.log('🔍 Debug Callback Page Loaded:', {
      url: location.href,
      params: Object.fromEntries(new URLSearchParams(location.search).entries()),
      timestamp: new Date().toISOString()
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>